@Server.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5240

### Health check
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/health

###
### Phase 2: all students
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students

### Phase 2: one student (try 99 for a 404)
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/1

###
### Phase 3: create (try the same email twice for a 409, or an invalid body for a 400)
POST {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Neha Patel", "email": "neha@example.com", "course": "Civil", "year": 1 }

### Phase 3: update
PUT {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Asha Verma", "email": "asha@example.com", "course": "Computer Science", "year": 4, "isActive": true }

### Phase 3: delete
DELETE {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/4

###
### Phase 4: search (name, email or course, case-insensitive)
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students?search=comp

###
### Phase 5: contacts
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts

### Phase 5: create a contact (send an empty name / bad email to see fieldErrors)
POST {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Neha Patel", "email": "neha@example.com", "phone": "+91 99999 11111" }

### Phase 5: favourite
PUT {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/2/favourite
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isFavourite": true }

###
### Phase 7: categories and products (sort = name | priceAsc | priceDesc)
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories

###
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?category=pizza&sort=priceDesc

###
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/4

###
### Phase 8: demo login (Development only). Copy accessToken into @token below.
POST {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@redstar.dev", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@token = paste-accessToken-here

GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 for admin, 403 for asha@redstar.dev, 401 with no token
GET {{Server.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
